---
// Hero section — landing page first fold
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-label">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        Anthropic 공식 파트너 · Claude Partner Network
      </div>
      <h1>
        AI/AX를 교육하고, 직접 구축해서,<br>
        <em>스스로 사용합니다</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        Syncarion은 부서장 14명의 AI 에이전트 조직으로 자기 사업 전체를 운영합니다.<br>
        고객에게 제안하는 모든 구조는 본인 사업에서 먼저 상시 가동됩니다.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">무료 진단 상담 →</a>
        <a href="/portfolio" class="btn-secondary">케이스 스터디 보기</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div><b>28</b><span>AI 에이전트 편제</span></div>
        <div><b>247</b><span>프로젝트 계획서</span></div>
        <div><b>271</b><span>위키 지식카드</span></div>
        <div><b>24/7</b><span>무인 파이프라인</span></div>
        <div><b>8</b><span>공개 케이스</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    right: -30%;
    width: 800px;
    height: 800px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, var(--color-accent-glow) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 160px 0 120px;
  }

  .hero-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; }
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.1s ease both;
  }

  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.2s ease both;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.3s ease both;
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .hero-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 56px;
    max-width: 760px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s ease both;
  }
  .hero-stats > div {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 16px 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-stats b {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .hero-stats span { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--color-text-dim); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-content { padding: 120px 0 80px; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; }
    .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .hero-stats > div:last-child { grid-column: span 2; }
  }
</style>
